{"b":"Ps","c":99,"v":[{"n":1,"t":"The LORD reigneth; let the people tremble: he sitteth between the cherubims; let the earth be moved.","it":[[54,61]],"x":[["Ps.97.1",8,"e"],["Exod.25.22",7,"w"],["Ps.97.4",6,"r"],["Ps.93.1",6,"w"],["Ps.80.1",5,"w"],["Rev.20.11",5,"r"],["Isa.19.14",4,"r"],["Jer.50.46",4,"w"],["Luke.19.14",4,"r"],["Ps.96.10",4,"e"]]},{"n":2,"t":"The LORD is great in Zion; and he is high above all the people.","it":[[9,11],[34,36]],"x":[["Ps.97.9",9,"e"],["Isa.14.32",4,"e"],["Isa.12.6",3,"w"],["Dan.4.34",2,"w"],["Dan.4.35",2,"r"],["Ps.113.4",2,"e"],["Ps.50.2",2,"w"],["Ps.48.1",2,"r"],["Ps.48.3",2,"r"],["Ps.76.1",2,"r"]]},{"n":3,"t":"Let them praise thy great and terrible name; for it is holy.","it":[[45,48],[52,54]],"x":[["Isa.6.3",7,"r"],["Deut.28.58",6,"r"],["Ps.111.9",4,"r"],["Ps.66.3",3,"w"],["Neh.4.14",3,"w"],["Rev.15.3",3,"r"],["Rev.15.4",3,"r"],["Ps.145.17",3,"r"],["John.17.11",3,"r"],["Josh.24.19",3,"r"]]},{"n":4,"t":"The king’s strength also loveth judgment; thou dost establish equity, thou executest judgment and righteousness in Jacob.","x":[["Ps.11.7",6,"w"],["Ps.45.6",3,"r"],["Ps.45.7",3,"w"],["Job.36.5",3,"w"],["Job.36.7",3,"w"],["Jer.23.5",3,"w"],["Rev.19.16",3,"r"],["Job.37.23",2,"w"],["Deut.10.18",2,"w"],["Isa.9.7",2,"w"]]},{"n":5,"t":"Exalt ye the LORD our God, and worship at his footstool; for he is holy.","it":[[57,60],[64,66]],"x":[["Ps.132.7",10,"w"],["Ps.108.5",6,"r"],["Isa.66.1",6,"w"],["Exod.15.2",5,"w"],["Ps.34.3",5,"w"],["Isa.25.1",4,"w"],["Isa.12.4",4,"r"],["Ps.99.3",4,"r"],["Ps.118.28",3,"w"],["Ps.107.32",3,"w"]]},{"n":6,"t":"Moses and Aaron among his priests, and Samuel among them that call upon his name; they called upon the LORD, and he answered them.","x":[["Jer.15.1",9,"w"],["Exod.24.6",4,"r"],["Exod.24.8",4,"r"],["Exod.15.25",3,"r"],["Exod.14.15",3,"r"],["1Sam.7.9",3,"w"],["1Sam.7.12",3,"e"],["1Sam.12.18",3,"w"],["1Sam.12.24",3,"r"],["Lev.8.1",2,"r"]]},{"n":7,"t":"He spake unto them in the cloudy pillar: they kept his 